.TH SCHED_GETPARAM 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_getparam \- reads scheduling parameters for a thread; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_getparam(pid_t process, struct sched_param* parameter);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads scheduling parameters for a thread; process zero selects the caller.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_getparam (2)
